WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.821
Partition didn't happen overnight.

2
00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:04.818
Its political road ran over

3
00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:06.290
four decades.

4
00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.087
The Muslim League was founded

5
00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:10.861
at Dhaka in 1906.

6
00:00:10.861 --> 00:00:13.861
Its Lahore Resolution came in

7
00:00:13.861 --> 00:00:18.234
1940. Partition followed in 1947.

8
00:00:18.582 --> 00:00:21.701
Separate electorates from 1909 hardened

9
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.795
divisions. And the Cabinet Mission

10
00:00:24.795 --> 00:00:27.104
talks of 1946 failed.

11
00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:29.260
Write about it with care.

12
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.168
Partition displaced millions,

13
00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:33.010
and cost many lives.

14
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.916
Your turn.

15
00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:36.778
When was it passed?
